                <h3 class="postingHeader">Job Description and Duties</h3>
                <p class="postingContent">
                    <p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt;">IRONWOOD STATE PRISON IS LOCATED IN BLYTHE, CA, WHICH IS ON THE BORDER OF ARIZONA AND CALIFORNIA.<br /><br />Physician and Surgeon, CF (Internal Med/Family Practice)&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span id="ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder_MainContent_ucJobPosting_General_ucJobPosting_General_Salary1_gvRanges_ctl02_lblPayRangeMin" style="border: 0px; background: #ffffff; text-decoration-color: initial;">$149.43</span><span style="text-decoration-color: initial;">-&nbsp;</span><span id="ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder_MainContent_ucJobPosting_General_ucJobPosting_General_Salary1_gvRanges_ctl02_lblPayRangeMax" style="border: 0px; background: #ffffff; text-decoration-color: initial;">$166.02</span>&nbsp;hourly rate<br /></span></strong></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 8pt; line-height: 1.07917;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">This Job Control is listed Until Filled. Applications will be reviewed on the following dates:</span></span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 8pt; line-height: 1.07917;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">11/15/24, 11/29/24, 12/13/24, 12/27/24, 1/10/25, 1/24/25, 2/7/25, 2/21/25, 3/7/25, 3/21/25, 4/4/25, 4/18/25</span></span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span>California Correctional Health Care Services (CCHCS) is seeking physicians currently employed with the state of California who are interested in additional appointments to provide after-hours coverage in a part-time capacity. &nbsp;For maximum allowable hours and location availability, please contact the Regional Hiring Unit.</span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p><div><p style="font-size: 11pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span><span style="color: #333333;">	</span></span></span></p><p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 10pt; text-align: left; line-height: 1.15; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span><span style="color: #0000ff; text-decoration: underline;"> </span></span></span></p><span style="font-size: 12pt;"> </span></div><p>You will find additional information about the job in the <strong><a href='https://www.CalCareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/FileDownload.aspx?aid=23276618&name=P-SIMFP(ClassCode9263).pdf' target='_blank'>Duty Statement</a></strong>.</p>
